Green: 625 passing, 0 failing, exit 0.

Bug was one line in `src/pricing.js:41` — tax computed on original `cents` instead of discounted amount:

```js
const tax = roundCents(cents * taxRate);
return discounted + tax;
```

Now:

```js
const discounted = applyDiscount(cents, discountPct);
return applyTax(discounted, taxRate);
```

Matches doc comment above function ("take discount off, then tax what's actually owed"). Only 3 of 69 order-total rows had both discount and tax nonzero — rest masked it. No other suite touched.
